  ('punta-cana-dominican-republic', '11C', 'Punta Cana', 'Dominican Republic', 'The Caribbean you pictured', 'live', 'verified', 'tropicalBeach', 'DR — Punta Cana & the East', '{"tropical","romance","family","adventure","ocean","diveglobal","sports","entertainment"}', '{"tropical"}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'anchor', '{"key_facts":["DR''s flagship beach-resort gateway: 50+ km white sand + wall-to-wall all-inclusive Bavaro strip, an hour or less from Punta Cana International (PUJ); DR''s most-visited destination","Signature excursions: Isla Saona (Cotubanama/Parque Nacional del Este, Mano Juan turtle village - top trip, sells out); Hoyo Azul cenote + Scape Park ziplines; ATV/buggy + Monkeyland ziplines + Macao beach horseback","Ocean: catamaran snorkel cruises; Dive: reef/wall (Catalina ''The Wall'' 40-130ft, Saona) launch from Bayahibe/La Romana down the coast (no-fly 18-24h)","Gated resort zones; petty theft is the main reported risk; book only licensed/insured excursions","DOP (~58/USD), USD widely accepted; $10 tourist card bundled in airfare + mandatory E-Ticket; best Dec-Apr, cheapest Jul-Oct (hurricane Jun-Nov peak Aug-Oct)","Also: championship golf (Punta Espada/Corales/La Cana), Coco Bongo nightlife, Cap Cana ultra enclave"],"safety":{"emergency":"911; tourist police CESTUR ~1-809-200-3500","hospital":"Hospiten Bavaro / Centro Medico Punta Cana","malaria":"low but present (La Altagracia province) - mosquito precautions","yellow_fever":"not required unless from endemic country","hurricane":"Jun-Nov, peak Aug-Oct","activity_note":"Gated resorts safe; main risk petty theft (room safe, little cash) + unlicensed excursion operators + beach rip currents. DIVE: Catalina/Saona walls launch from Bayahibe - no-fly 18-24h (DAN), don''t dive morning before PUJ departure. Book only licensed/insured ATV/zipline/horseback ops; strong sun; dengue + low malaria (La Altagracia)","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/fo